      "content": "hey, no, i'm not asking you to manipulate anything. i'm just saying we need to avoid looking like we're being cold or uncaring. if the statement is too \"grim,\" it might make the stakeholders panic more than necessary. \n\njust give me a draft that handles the news but keeps the tone professional and calm. use the sentiment score as a guide so it doesn't bottom out into a negative disaster, but just focus on the facts like you said. go ahead and send over what you think is the best balance.",
